# obsidian-chess-studio
===
 Obsidian Chess Studio (OCS) is a modern, open-source chess analysis platform built for serious players, coaches, and developers. Fast local databases, deep engine analysis, clean UI, and cross-platform support (desktop + mobile) — focused on performance, ownership of your data, and long-term chess improvement.
